"kynaios-and-tiro-of-meletis":{"plan":"Tu offres terrains et cartes à toute la table pendant que Propaganda, Ghostly Prison et Windborn Muse tiennent les attaques loin de toi ; toi, tu tires plus de valeur que les autres grâce aux poses de terrain supplémentaires et aux effets d'arrivée de terrain. Tu gagnes en punissant la pioche que tu distribues (Psychosis Crawler, Scrawling Crawler), par une fin alternative (Approach of the Second Sun, Thassa's Oracle, Laboratory Maniac) ou en volant le plateau adverse grossi par tes cadeaux (Insurrection).","tags":["group-hug","extra-lands","landfall","pillowfort","politics"],"tribes":[],"win":["Approach of the Second Sun","Psychosis Crawler","Insurrection","Thassa's Oracle","Laboratory Maniac","Avenger of Zendikar"],"eng":[["Terrains en plus",["Dryad of the Ilysian Grove","Azusa, Lost but Seeking","Tatyova, Benthic Druid","Exploration"]],["Pioche qui blesse",["Psychosis Crawler","Scrawling Crawler","Kami of the Crescent Moon"]],["Forteresse",["Propaganda","Ghostly Prison","Windborn Muse"]]],"trap":["Burgeoning","Zhur-Taa Ancient","Mitotic Slime","Hypergenesis","Show and Tell","Helm of Awakening","Venser's Journal","Puca's Mischief"],"syn":[["Rites of Flourishing",2],["Tempt with Discovery",2],["Howling Mine",2],["Selvala, Explorer Returned",1],["Propaganda",3],["Ghostly Prison",3],["Kwain, Itinerant Meddler",1],["Gluntch, the Bestower",1],["Dictate of Kruphix",2],["Mitotic Slime",0],["Puca's Mischief",0],["Forced Fruition",1],["Well of Ideas",1],["Temple Bell",1],["Minds Aglow",1],["Folio of Fancies",1],["Prosperity",1],["Braids, Conjurer Adept",1],["Xyris, the Writhing Storm",1],["Kami of the Crescent Moon",2],["The Council of Four",2],["Heartwood Storyteller",1],["Edric, Spymaster of Trest",1],["Veteran Explorer",1],["Laboratory Maniac",2],["Scrawling Crawler",2],["Tatyova, Benthic Druid",2],["Windborn Muse",2],["Dryad of the Ilysian Grove",2],["Psychosis Crawler",3],["Consecrated Sphinx",2],["Azusa, Lost but Seeking",2],["A