"lathril-blade-of-the-elves":{"plan":"Tu poses très vite des Elfes producteurs de mana, tu élargis le plateau avec des créateurs de jetons Elfes, puis tu actives Lathril en engageant dix Elfes : chaque adversaire perd 10 PV. Avec de quoi dégager Lathril (Seedborn Muse, Wirewood Symbiote) tu actives deux à quatre fois par tour de table, ce qui suffit à tuer les trois adversaires ; sinon Craterhoof ou Ezuri finissent en combat. Lathril lui-même, avec la menace, transforme ses blessures en jetons Elfes.","tags":["tribal","tokens-creature","go-wide","drain","untap"],"tribes":["Elf"],"win":["Craterhoof Behemoth","Ezuri, Renegade Leader","Seedborn Muse","Shaman of the Pack","Overwhelming Stampede"],"eng":[["Mana des Elfes",["Elvish Archdruid","Priest of Titania","Circle of Dreams Druid","Staff of Domination"]],["Drain répété de Lathril",["Seedborn Muse","Wirewood Symbiote","Elvish Promenade"]],["Pioche tribale",["Beast Whisperer","Skullclamp","Shamanic Revelation"]]],"trap":["Toxic Deluge","Fog","Rhys the Exiled","Celeborn the Wise","Bloodline Pretender","Glissa Sunslayer"],"syn":[["Elvish Archdruid",3],["Llanowar Elves",2],["Priest of Titania",3],["Elvish Mystic",2],["Imperious Perfect",2],["Marwyn, the Nurturer",2],["Beast Whisperer",2],["Reclamation Sage",1],["Elvish Warmaster",3],["Dwynen, Gilt-Leaf Daen",2],["High Perfect Morcant",1],["Crown of Skemfar",1],["Timberwatch Elf",1],["Leaf-Crowned Visionary",2],["Shaman of the Pack",2],["Lys Alana Huntmaster",2],["Fyndhorn Elves",2],["Canopy Tactician",2],["Ezuri, Renegade Leader",3],["Skemfar Shadowsage",2],["Wirewood Channeler",2],["Elvish Champion",1],["Wolverine Riders",1],["Circle of Dreams Druid",2],["Craterhoof Behemoth",3],["Dionus, Elvish Archdruid",2],["Elves of Deep Shadow",1],["Elvish Harbinger",2],["Seedborn Muse",3],["Heritage Druid",2],["Wirewood Symbiote",2],["Allosaurus Shepherd",1],["Galadhrim Brigade",1],["Joraga Warcaller",1],["Copperhorn Scout",1],["Elvish Visionary",1],["Tyvar the Bellicose",1],["Elv