"phelddagrif":{"plan":"Tu joues le partage : Phelddagrif donne Hippos, PV et cartes aux adversaires pendant que Propaganda et Ghostly Prison découragent leurs attaques. Le vrai plan est de retourner ces cadeaux : avec Intruder Alarm et un elfe à mana vert, chaque Hippo dégage tes créatures et donne des Hippos à l'infini, que Suture Priest transforme en pertes de vie (ou Soul Warden en vie infinie, Mantle of Leadership en Phelddagrif géant), et Reins of Power vole d'un coup tous les Hippos. Les fins alternatives (Approach of the Second Sun, Thassa's Oracle) servent de plan de secours.","tags":["group-hug","pillowfort","untap","etb","steal"],"tribes":[],"win":["Intruder Alarm","Suture Priest","Reins of Power","Approach of the Second Sun","Thassa's Oracle","Mantle of Leadership"],"eng":[["Hippos infinis",["Intruder Alarm","Birds of Paradise","Suture Priest","Soul Warden"]],["Retourner les cadeaux",["Reins of Power","Crafty Cutpurse","Ezuri's Predation"]],["Forteresse contre les Hippos",["Propaganda","Ghostly Prison","Reverence","Windborn Muse"]]],"trap":["Tempting Wurm","Flumph","Theft of Dreams","Briar Patch","Thunderstaff","Riot Control","Kismet"],"syn":[["Propaganda",3],["Questing Phelddagrif",1],["Ghostly Prison",3],["Selvala, Explorer Returned",1],["Rites of Flourishing",1],["Suture Priest",3],["Dictate of Kruphix",2],["Reins of Power",3],["Intruder Alarm",3],["Dingus Staff",1],["Mantle of Leadership",2],["Angel's Trumpet",2],["Orim's Prayer",1],["Reverence",2],["Mercy Killing",1],["Orbs of Warding",1],["Crafty Cutpurse",2],["Kwain, Itinerant Meddler",1],["Gluntch, the Bestower",1],["Birds of Paradise",2],["Kami of the Crescent Moon",2],["Windborn Muse",2],["Master of Ceremonies",1],["Seedborn Muse",2],["Noble Hierarch",2],["Soul Warden",2],["Edric, Spymaster of Trest",1],["Heartwood Storyteller",1],["Llanowar Elves",2],["Elvish Mystic",2],["Consecrated Sphinx",2],["Essence Warden",2],["Soul's Attendant",2],["Laboratory Maniac",1],["Thassa's Oracle",2],["Arachnoge