"the-ur-dragon":{"plan":"Tu accélères ton mana pour lancer des Dragons rendus moins chers par l'éminence, puis tu attaques avec eux : chaque attaque pioche une carte par Dragon et te laisse poser gratuitement un permanent de ta main (souvent un autre Dragon). Les sources de célérité et de dégâts d'arrivée (Dragon Tempest, Terror of the Peaks, Scourge of Valkas) et les copies de Miirym transforment chaque Dragon posé en blessures directes. Les Dragons volent, donc les balais comme Earthquake ne touchent que les autres.","tags":["tribal","cost-reduction","attack","haste","burn"],"tribes":["Dragon"],"win":["Terror of the Peaks","Scourge of Valkas","Dragon Tempest","Atarka, World Render","Balefire Dragon","Utvara Hellkite"],"eng":[["Ramp vers les Dragons",["Dragonspeaker Shaman","Urza's Incubator","Herald's Horn"]],["Célérité et dégâts d'arrivée",["Dragon Tempest","Terror of the Peaks","Scourge of Valkas"]],["Copies et jetons Dragons",["Miirym, Sentinel Wyrm","Utvara Hellkite","Ancient Copper Dragon"]]],"trap":["Worldgorger Dragon","Blasphemous Act","Scion of the Ur-Dragon","Two-Headed Hellkite","Shieldhide Dragon","Dragonlord's Servant","Bloodline Pretender","Ramos, Dragon Engine"],"syn":[["Miirym, Sentinel Wyrm",3],["Dragon Tempest",3],["Crux of Fate",2],["Tiamat",2],["Atarka, World Render",2],["Lathliss, Dragon Queen",2],["Dragonlord Dromoka",1],["Terror of the Peaks",3],["Temur Ascendancy",2],["Hellkite Courser",2],["Utvara Hellkite",3],["Dragonspeaker Shaman",2],["Old Gnawbone",2],["Goldspan Dragon",2],["Morophon, the Boundless",2],["Rivaz of the Claw",2],["Ancient Copper Dragon",2],["Sarkhan, Soul Aflame",1],["Scourge of Valkas",3],["Ureni of the Unwritten",1],["Ancient Silver Dragon",1],["Klauth, Unrivaled Ancient",2],["Birds of Paradise",1],["Balefire Dragon",2],["Savage Ventmaw",2],["Steel Hellkite",1],["Bonehoard Dracosaur",2],["Thundermane Dragon",1],["Earthquake",1],["Sarkhan's Triumph",1],["Herald's Horn",2],["Urza's Incubator",3],["The Great Henge",1],["Fi